WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.292 --> 00:00:02.860
- [Conan] Believe it or not
Comic-Con isn't the only thing

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:05.111
going on this week, the
Republican National Convention

00:00:05.111 --> 00:00:07.009
is also happening in Cleveland, yup.

00:00:07.009 --> 00:00:10.016
(audience booing)

00:00:10.016 --> 00:00:11.909
So there are a lot of fans here.

00:00:11.909 --> 00:00:13.776
In honor of both conventions happening

00:00:13.776 --> 00:00:14.896
at the same time, we thought
it'd be fun to bring out

00:00:14.896 --> 00:00:17.121
someone who represents both Comic-Con

00:00:17.121 --> 00:00:19.669
and the Republican party.

00:00:19.669 --> 00:00:20.620
He's here tonight.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:23.589
Please welcome Captain
Make America Great Again!

00:00:23.589 --> 00:00:25.931
(cheering, clapping)

00:00:25.931 --> 00:00:28.764
(grandiose music)

00:00:37.229 --> 00:00:38.395
- [Captain] Thanks, Conan.

00:00:38.395 --> 00:00:41.534
I've waited a very long time to be here.

00:00:41.534 --> 00:00:42.586
I have to tell you.

00:00:42.586 --> 00:00:43.551
- [Conan] We're all thrilled to have you,

00:00:43.551 --> 00:00:45.032
Captain Make America Great Again.

00:00:45.032 --> 00:00:45.918
- [Captain] Agreed, Conan.

00:00:45.918 --> 00:00:46.849
Now listen.

00:00:46.849 --> 00:00:50.233
Booking me is going to
be huge for America.

00:00:50.233 --> 00:00:54.740
Which needs my super
powers now more than ever.

00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:56.399
- [Conan] Okay, I'm sorry, what exactly

00:00:56.399 --> 00:00:57.898
are your super powers?

00:00:57.898 --> 00:01:00.091
- [Captain] Well, I have all
the best super powers, Conan.

00:01:00.091 --> 00:01:01.380
(audience laughing)

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:03.790
Believe me, I know super powers.

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:06.099
- [Conan] Okay, I just didn't
know you had any super powers.

00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:07.051
I'm not sure about that.

00:01:07.051 --> 00:01:08.491
- [Captain] Look, look, look, look.

00:01:08.491 --> 00:01:09.813
This city needs me, all right.

00:01:09.813 --> 00:01:12.738
I was walking around San
Diego today and frankly,

00:01:12.738 --> 00:01:14.068
this place is a dump.

00:01:14.068 --> 00:01:15.017
I have to tell you.

00:01:15.017 --> 00:01:16.324
(audience booing)

00:01:16.324 --> 00:01:17.869
A dump.

00:01:17.869 --> 00:01:19.430
- [Conan] Wow, wow.

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:21.019
- [Captain] Thank you, thank you.

00:01:21.019 --> 00:01:23.799
It's overrun, it's overrun with Wookies,

00:01:23.799 --> 00:01:25.753
zombies, and Klingons.

00:01:25.753 --> 00:01:28.794
(audience cheering)

00:01:28.794 --> 00:01:30.163
- [Conan] That's what it's supposed to be.

00:01:30.163 --> 00:01:31.164
It's Comic-Con.

00:01:31.164 --> 00:01:32.723
- [Captain] Well, let
me say this, all right.

00:01:32.723 --> 00:01:36.196
That Klingon planet, they're
not sending us their best.

00:01:36.196 --> 00:01:37.029
All right?

00:01:37.029 --> 00:01:37.975
(audience laughing)

00:01:37.975 --> 00:01:38.808
It's true.

00:01:39.657 --> 00:01:41.524
We're getting rapist Klingons.

00:01:41.524 --> 00:01:42.660
- [Conan] No, no we're not, no.

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:44.642
- [Captain] Drug dealing Klingons.

00:01:44.642 --> 00:01:45.623
- [Conan] That's not true, no.

00:01:45.623 --> 00:01:47.268
- [Captain] And they all
seem very, very angry

00:01:47.268 --> 00:01:49.094
and none of them speak English.

00:01:49.094 --> 00:01:50.735
- [Conan] Okay, that's offensive.

00:01:50.735 --> 00:01:52.365
Everything you just
said is very offensive.

00:01:52.365 --> 00:01:55.048
- [Captain] Conan, Conan,
I am going to build a wall.

00:01:55.048 --> 00:01:56.149
- [Conan] No, no.

00:01:56.149 --> 00:01:58.332
- [Captain] Between all
the planets and I will make

00:01:58.332 --> 00:01:59.876
the aliens pay for it.

00:01:59.876 --> 00:02:00.955
- [Conan] That's not, no.

00:02:00.955 --> 00:02:01.938
You should go.

00:02:01.938 --> 00:02:02.910
I think you should go.

00:02:02.910 --> 00:02:03.980
Your views are not welcome here.

00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:08.147
- [Captain] I will make San
Diego and America great again!

00:02:09.009 --> 00:02:11.269
(audience booing)

00:02:11.269 --> 00:02:12.761
Thank you, thank you.

00:02:12.761 --> 00:02:15.780
Because I am the hero Comic-Con needs

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:17.703
and the one it deserves.

00:02:17.703 --> 00:02:19.144
- [Conan] Yeah.

00:02:19.144 --> 00:02:20.310
(audience booing)

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:22.046
That's great, that's great.

00:02:22.046 --> 00:02:23.082
- [Captain] Hail Hydra!

00:02:23.082 --> 00:02:26.401
(cheering, clapping)

00:02:26.401 --> 00:02:27.780
- [Conan] Captain Make
America Great Again.

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:28.749
You should go.

00:02:28.749 --> 00:02:29.701
We'll be right back.

00:02:29.701 --> 00:02:30.651
(upbeat music)

00:02:30.651 --> 00:02:33.401
Nick Kroll is here, stick around.

